    "description": "Type: Auxiliary!\nPre-req: Strength! one grade higher than grade of skill\n\nCreatures with this skill for one reason or another gained the ability to exert much\ngreater strength/force than others. This skill only applies to a creature's ability to lift,\ncarry, and push targets. The max amount increases per grade. The weight listed is in\naddition to character's base carrying capabilities based on strength stat:\n\n●   F - 200lbs (90.72 KG) (average equipped human)\n●   E - 600lbs (272.16 KG) (average grizzly bear)\n●   D - 1ton (0.91 MT) (rhino or baby whale)\n●   C - 2ton (1.81 MT) (mid-sized car)\n●   B - 5ton (4.54 MT) (adult Elephant)\n●   A - 10ton (9.07 MT) (80ft hardwood tree)\n●   S - ???\n#\n\nMagic",
