    "description": "Type: Auxiliary!\nPre-req: Intelligence! one grade higher than grade of skill\n\nOne of your senses (hearing, smell, sight, taste, touch) is superior to the norm and\nallows you to pick up on details otherwise not available normally. Can be used to\n\ndiscern the reality of your situation if the skill rank is equal to or greater than the\nsituation. Each grade of the skill permits another sense to be acquired in addition to\nincreasing the strength of the skill overall. Ex: seeing, hearing, or sniffing out a hidden\nadversary.",
