    "prerequisite": "Vitality! one grade higher than grade of skill",
    "note": "Reducing character HP to 0 will knock character unconscious. Alternatively, character can remain active at 0 HP with Conversion, but will die and/or suffer major consequences at narrator discretion. Any damage to HP received at 0 HP will kill character. Conversion benefits do not stack with other stat effectiveness boosts.",
    "restrictions": [],
    "description": "Type: Ability!, Buff!, Utility!\nPre-req: Vitality! one grade higher than grade of skill\nNote: Reducing character HP to 0 will knock character unconscious. Alternatively,\ncharacter can remain active at 0 HP with Conversion, but will die and/or suffer major\nconsequences at narrator discretion. Any damage to HP received at 0 HP will kill\ncharacter. Conversion benefits do not stack with other stat effectiveness boosts.\n\nCharacter takes pain, damage, hardship, etc. and turns it into power. Character can\nactivate Conversion. Each round the character has it activated including the first, they\nlose 1 point of HP per point of stat effectiveness in all their stats. Higher grades of\nconversation can burn through health faster for same stat effectiveness bonus in all\nstats. Duration of Conversion cannot be prolonged by any other skill and relies solely on\ncharacter HP to remain applicable. Once conversion is done, character cannot be\nhealed by any healing or regenerative abilities until the conversion's ability cooldown is\nover.",
